  def heading "Scope"
    level 2

  def heading "In Scope - Phase 1 (MVP Launch April 1)"
    level 3

  def list
    items """✅ Complete visual redesign (all 12 core pages)
✅ New component-based design system
✅ Mobile-first responsive implementation
✅ Performance optimization (Core Web Vitals)
✅ SEO improvements (metadata, schema, sitemap)
✅ New CMS integration (Webflow or Contentful)
✅ Contact form improvements + Salesforce integration
✅ Analytics setup (GA4, Hotjar)"""

  def heading "Out of Scope (Phase 2 - Post-Launch)"
    level 3

  def list
    items """❌ Blog redesign (existing blog remains, address in Q2)
❌ Customer portal/login area
❌ E-commerce functionality
❌ Multi-language support
❌ Video production (using existing assets)"""

